.63% - ad-hoc-news.de"},{"title":"Cisco Systems, Inc. $CSCO Stock Position Reduced by Bokf Na","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOQ1drMkFrZFBwVkpBQmZmbWloMVlORGp3QjB0YUNHX1pVOUdkNlFMRXNNNVJEZHFIZVZQNnJ5NEFGaGswSkdwVlNtVjhWa3dBVlVNZnZTLTdqZ1ZHY0tJOTVwVlowX2FYamJlUDF4TzE5emhCc0ctbFd4NklKQ0RkMmJuak9Fa04xWFp5cF94RDM0aVdNVWd0M254X29IdldFOV9HdGF1UkpSb05zX0Y0Y0ZvSkFxejhZ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"思科系統公司 $CSCO 股票部位由 Bokf Na 減持"},{"title":"Cisco Systems, Inc. $CSCO Stock: Simplify Asset Management Inc. Lowers Holdings","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"思科系統公司 $CSCO 股票：簡化資產管理公司降低持股"},{"title":"Conning Inc. Acquires 65,355 Shares of Cisco Systems, Inc. $CSCO","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQWXFJMnk0MExoM09Wbml6YnZtSE1qamZkU3B1Rm13WlI5NlNiTnpPOV94eWVDdnBoUFBkbXg5cXRyUzd2a29xN2pxTDhmaE1sblNQTTY3VFY4bFVwaEpGNjNZMEZMMER3M3hMQzlydWY0WGZnMjdUdUhySFQyNUFxWWRIclJKMDJ0SmN5OHliNGUyeVlMMjRsT3M3dDFpNzlBUzhZY3JmaWtpbnVHOTJ0X3A5ODdmOVRZVlhfbA?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Conning Inc. 收購 Cisco Systems, Inc. 65,355 股股票 $CSCO"}],"themes":[{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":2},{"name":"關稅/貿易","count":2},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-09-02","period":"2026-07-25","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/858877/000085887726000132/csco-20260725.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Cisco designs and sells a broad range of technologies including hardware, software, and artificial intelligence (AI) powered digital infrastructure to power, help secure, and draw insights from the Internet. We are incorporating AI into our product portfolios across networking, security, collaboration and observability, as well as integrating our products more tightly together into a platform. We are simplifying how our technology is delivered, managed and optimized and helping customers maximize the business value of their technology investments.","zh":"思科设计和销售广泛的技术，包括硬件、软件和人工智慧 (AI) 驱动的数字基础设施，以支持、帮助保护互联网并从互联网中获取见解。我们正在将人工智慧纳入我们的网络、安全、协作和可观察性产品组合中，并将我们的产品更紧密地集成到一个平台中。我們正在簡化技術的交付、管理和優化方式，並幫助客戶最大限度地提高其技術投資的商業價值。"},{"en":"We conduct our business globally and manage our business by geography. Our business is organized into the following three geographic segments: Americas; Europe, Middle East, and Africa (EMEA); and Asia Pacific, Japan, and China (APJC).","zh":"我們在全球範圍內開展業務並按地理位置管理我們的業務。我們的業務分為以下三個地理區域：美洲；歐洲、中東和非洲 (EMEA)；以及亞太地區、日本和中國 (APJC)。"},{"en":"Our products and technologies are grouped into the following categories: Networking, Security, Collaboration and Observability. In addition to our product offerings, we provide a broad range of services over the lifecycle of our products, including technical support services and professional services. Our customers include businesses of all sizes, public institutions, governments, and service providers, including hyperscalers. These customers often look to us as a strategic partner to help them use technology to differentiate themselves and drive positive business outcomes.","zh":"我們的產品和技術分為以下幾類：網路、安全、協作和可觀察。除了我們的產品之外，我們還在產品的生命週期中提供廣泛的服務，包括技術支援服務和專業服務。我們的客戶包括各種規模的企業、公共機構、政府和服務提供者（包括超大規模企業）。這些客戶經常將我們視為策略合作夥伴，幫助他們利用科技脫穎而出並推動積極的業務成果。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-07-25","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":37799000000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"Europe Middle East & Africa","val":16613000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲部門"},{"name":"Asia Pacific Japan & China","val":8914000000,"zh":"亞太地區日本及中國市場"}],"total":63325000000},"prod":{"end":"2026-07-25","items":[{"name":"Networking","val":34668000000,"zh":"網通"},{"name":"Subscription & Circulation","val":31977000000,"zh":"認購及流通"},{"name":"Subscription Revenue Product","val":18314000000,"zh":"訂閱收入產品"},{"name":"Service","val":15030000000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Subscription Revenue Service","val":13663000000,"zh":"訂閱收入服務"},{"name":"Security","val":8232000000,"zh":"安全"},{"name":"Collaboration","val":4300000000,"zh":"合作"},{"name":"Observability","val":1095000000,"zh":"可觀察性"}],"total":63325000000}},"peers":["ORCL","INTC","IBM","QCOM","PFE"]}}